      "section_path": "Part I Item 1 > Overview.",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 1",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Overview.",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Our teams have established a portfolio of proprietary software content for the major hardware and mobile platforms, and we aim to be at the forefront of technological innovation.",
