      "section_label": "Part I Item 1",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Overview.",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "We have a diverse portfolio that spans all key platforms and numerous genres, including action, adventure, family, casual, hyper-casual, role-playing, shooter, social casino, sports, and strategy.",
